  "description": "UWERIY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C74 H86 Dy4 N12 O19,3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.461-4.140 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.07-129.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ4-O)(μ-OMe)2(beh)2(esh)4]·3MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
